 "rule": [
  "Schemas are copied from $defs with $ref rewritten from #/$defs/ to #/schemas/.",
  "Annotation keywords are removed: description, title and format. A property named title stays.",
  "const is rewritten as a one-member enum, which the checker implements.",
  "ContentBlock keeps its TextContent branch only; the bridge writes text content alone.",
  "TextContent loses its optional annotations property, whose Annotations schema uses minimum and maximum.",
  "Tool.inputSchema gains additionalProperties: true. It is a JSON Schema object, which carries keywords the published schema does not name."
 ],
